  "commit": "f93a27812534b2c1e2465dff52172fa763d631dd",
  "sourceContract": "docs/embedding-chat-view.md (source-only embed; published web dist is not used)",
  "selection": "Client chat-embed barrel and transitive source inputs, upstream session actions/connection/banner/question stack, and the required public-entry closure of client-utils + dashboard-plugin-runtime. No App/main entry, provisioning, plugin registry, server tooling, or second application is mounted.",
  "license": "MIT; original text in LICENSE",
  "localChanges": [
    "TSX compilation metadata: @jsxImportSource react pragmas for the Solid host.",
    "hooks/useWebSocket.ts: optional hostAuthenticated mode skips Dashboard identity endpoints, stops on host policy/auth close; stock reconnect and never-sent outbox retained.",
    "hooks/useSessionState.ts: update() lets unchanged upstream session actions use the same accumulator for optimistic pending input.",
    "components/settings/ThemeProvider.tsx + chat-embed/EmbedProviders.tsx: optional supplied host theme avoids root mutations and Dashboard preferences.",
    "lib/questions/questions-api.ts: optional scoped transport; default fetch/error semantics unchanged.",
    "client-utils/src/DialogPortal.tsx + client/src/components/questions/QuestionStack.tsx: honor the existing LayerHostContext for isolated host overlays; standalone portal/scroll behavior retained.",
    "client/src/index.css: omit generated optional Dashboard application-plugin Tailwind source import; scan only the retained source siblings.",
    "client/src/components/interactive-renderers/BatchRenderer.tsx: Codeflare questionnaire metadata opt-in adds authored labels/descriptions, bounded full-Markdown previews, per-question/review notes and all-question completion gating. Keeps native choice indices separate from Other drafts; emits stock batch value/values plus codeflare optionIndexes/text, optional notes and final-entry globalNote, without automatic/provenance claims. Ordinary batches retain upstream behavior; original source inventory and hashes remain the upstream baseline.",
    "Formatting only: remove upstream extra blank line at EOF in client/src/components/tool-renderers/ReadToolRenderer.tsx for the repository whitespace gate; original source hash retained."
  ],
